Source: https://github.com/Arcadesys/message-in-a-bottle

This release contains separately licensed original contributions and
excluded third-party material. It is not licensed as one undifferentiated
package. A file's format or location does not expand the grants below.

MIT software grant
------------------
The licensor's original software contributions in these files are licensed
under the MIT License, whose complete text and copyright notice are in
LICENSE-MIT:

- app/runner.mjs
- scripts/build-site.mjs
- app/run-state.mjs
- app/module.css
- app/illustrated-guide/styles.css and app/illustrated-guide/script.js
- Original HTML interface and layout code in index.html, app/index.html,
  app/module.html, app/handouts.html, and app/illustrated-guide/index.html
- Original workflow code in .github/workflows/

Campaign prose, data, images, third-party material, and referenced GitHub
Actions are outside this software grant. Embedded original campaign
content has the separate content license below. Keep the complete MIT
copyright and permission notice with copies or substantial portions of
the covered software.

CC BY 4.0 content grant
----------------------
The licensor's original campaign prose, handouts, characters, scene
descriptions, and adventure procedures in source/, app/campaign.json,
app/module.md, app/handouts.md, app/illustrated-guide/stat-blocks.md,
and app/illustrated-guide/encounters.md,
and the same original content reproduced
in HTML and PDFs, are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0). source/sessions.mjs holds campaign data and is
in this content scope, rather than the software scope.

The licensor's original copyrightable illustration contributions, only
to the extent the licensor holds those rights, in these files and their
PDF reproductions are also licensed under CC BY 4.0:

- app/assets/chicago-snowglobe.webp
- app/assets/primordial-archipelago.webp
- app/assets/thompson-maze.webp
- Identical copies of these three illustrations in app/illustrated-guide/images/

Human-directed AI tools assisted production. This grant does not claim
exclusive copyright in every generated element or impose new restrictions
on public-domain elements or uses permitted by copyright exceptions.

The complete, unmodified CC BY 4.0 legal text is in LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.
Canonical license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Credit the work and creator, retain supplied applicable copyright,
license and disclaimer notices, provide a link to the license and source
where reasonably practicable, and indicate changes as the license requires.
A suggested credit is:

