Exclusions and the Savage Worlds fan edition
-------------------------------------------
Neither grant licenses rights the licensor does not hold. Excluded
material includes Pinnacle Entertainment Group's Savage Worlds/SWADE
rulebook text and other protected material, settings, logos and trademarks;
app/assets/savage-worlds-fan.png and its identical copy in
app/illustrated-guide/images/savage-worlds-fan.png; and any other third-party text, artwork,
fonts or assets. Such material retains its own permissions and notices.
The grants apply only to separable original contributions within mixed
files, HTML, PDFs and the release ZIP. A bundled copy of excluded material
does not become licensed under MIT or CC BY 4.0.

The author's separate novels and private player materials are not covered.
The tabletop remix's original contributions in this release are covered
only as stated above. No endorsement or official Pinnacle approval is
implied.

The assembled Savage Worlds fan edition remains free under Pinnacle's
separate, applicable Fan License:
https://shop.peginc.com/pages/licensing

Anyone publishing a Savage Worlds version must independently comply with
Pinnacle's terms. The Fan License grants non-assignable permission to
reference the system; it requires the unaltered fan logo on the front
display and the notice below, prohibits charging or accepting compensation
for the fan product, prohibits reproducing copyrighted works without
express written permission, and excludes Pinnacle settings and other
licensed properties. Pinnacle may change or revoke its permission.
Commercial reuse of covered original contributions does not authorize
selling this Savage Worlds package or using Pinnacle's protected material,
branding or settings. This describes separate third-party requirements;
it adds no restriction to MIT or CC BY 4.0 for covered original material.

